    "title": "Tampa Restaurant Brings Rome Pizza Style to Dale Mabry Location - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jim Mayhew ,\n2 days ago Piccolo Buco opened in Tampa on Nov. 23. The restaurant brings pizza-making techniques from a Rome pizzeria near the Trevi Fountain. Located at 14904 North Dale Mabry Highway, it welcomes guests starting at 11 a.m. each day. Luca Issa owns the original location in Rome. Cooper's Hawk Founder Tim McEnery... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
